Package: opennaijR
Title: Reproducible Macroeconomic Data Engineering for Africa
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lawrence", "Garba",
           email = "laws.garba@gmail.com",
           role  = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "")),
    person("Infosights Consulting",
           email = "infosights.yo@gmail.com",
           role  = "fnd")
    )
Description: Provides programmatic access to official macroeconomic data
    from African central banks and national statistics bureaus, starting
    with the Central Bank of Nigeria (CBN). Automates the retrieval,
    cleaning, and transformation of institutional datasets into
    analysis-ready R objects. Includes tools for schema management,
    feature engineering, and reproducible audit trails.
